        {
            "jpName": "ミホノブルボン",
            "enName": "Mihono Bourbon",
            "jpText": "ムカデですね。咬まれると危険ですので\r\n処分いたしましょう。",
            "enText": "A centipede at that. My data says their\nbite is poisonous, so I shall proceed with\ntermination protocol.",
