        {
            "jpName": "ライスシャワー",
            "enName": "Rice Shower",
            "jpText": "えっ、しょ、処分！？",
            "enText": "Huh? T-Termination?!",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -6764412533653878380,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ミホノブルボン",
            "enName": "Mihono Bourbon",
            "jpText": "はい。迅速かつ確実に処理いたしますので\r\nご安心ください。",
            "enText": "Yes. Do not worry. I will deal with this\nin the most efficient manner possible.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -4210687445058031491,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライスシャワー",
            "enName": "Rice Shower",
            "jpText": "あ、あう……あの……\r\n気持ちはうれしいんだけど……。",
            "enText": "I-I… Um… I appreciate the thought, but…",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": -4247663294426228189,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライスシャワー",
            "enName": "Rice Shower",
            "jpText": "虫さん、お外に逃がしてあげたい。\r\n……だめ、かな？",
            "enText": "Can't we just take Mr. Centipede outside?\n…Pretty please?",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 894952734253361462,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ミホノブルボン",
            "enName": "Mihono Bourbon",
            "jpText": "……問題ありません。\r\nですがライスさん、恐怖を感じているのでは？",
            "enText": "…I see no reason to argue.\nBut are you not frightened, Rice?",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": -5157528860363396362,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライスシャワー",
            "enName": "Rice Shower",
            "jpText": "た、たしかに怖いけど……\r\nでも、虫さんは、もっと怖い思い\nしてると思うから……！",
            "enText": "I-I am scared, but… I'm sure Mr. Centipede\nis even more scared than me!",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": 2684800445468841608,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライスシャワー",
